      "level": 1,
      "content": "The gap Property"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You can add space between all flex items at once using the gap property, which removes the need for individual margins."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<div class=\"container\">\n2    <div class=\"box box1\">First Item</div>\n3    <div class=\"box box2\">Second Item</div>\n4    <div class=\"box box3\">Third Item</div>\n5</div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1.container {\n2    display: flex;\n3    gap: 10px;\n4}"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
